# Property Module Structure

- API routes: `backend/app/api/routes/property/`
  - route file: `properties.py` (expects `router = APIRouter(...)`)
  - router is wired from `backend/app/main.py` via `from app.api.routes.property import properties`
- Models: `backend/app/models/property/`
  - SQLAlchemy model(s) go here (e.g. `property.py`)
- Schemas: `backend/app/schemas/property/`
  - Pydantic schemas go here
- Services: `backend/app/services/property/`
  - create only when you add non-trivial business logic beyond route + DB calls
- Shared helpers: `backend/app/utils/` (only cross-cutting)

